---
title: "migrate::migrate (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_handle: handle_migrate(pyth_state, receipt)
    q_handle --> q_version: state::migrate_version(pyth_state)
    q_version --> q_latest: latest_only = state::assert_latest_only(pyth_state)
    q_latest --> q_digest: digest = contract_upgrade::take_upgrade_digest(receipt)
    q_digest --> q_assert: state::assert_authorized_digest(latest_only, pyth_state, digest)
    q_assert --> q_package: package = state::current_package(latest_only, pyth_state)
    q_package --> q_emit: event::emit(MigrateComplete(package))
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_assert
        INV-001: migrate_version rolls version from previous to current
        INV-002: authorized digest must match the upgrade VAA's digest
        INV-003: migration is NOT atomic with upgrade (separate transactions)
        INV-004: one-off migration logic can be inserted before return
    end note
